                                "sense_id": "096a03c2-5ecb-3c85-b616-f0fa87fd7a6b",
                                "text": "... a haggy cackle."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d287633-2a3d-4740-9899-1acc004d5a2c",
                                "sense_id": "096a03c2-5ecb-3c85-b616-f0fa87fd7a6b",
                                "text": "A haggy pregnant woman, covering herself with her sleeve, was standing near the stove."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d05adad0-ea69-4028-a6e3-528851ce8a3a",
                                "sense_id": "096a03c2-5ecb-3c85-b616-f0fa87fd7a6b",
                                "text": "[I don't want to be] a haggy-looking old thing dying. I want to go with a little peace and dignity."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1e2e7756-2fcb-4e80-ba4a-f64ca3cf1695",
                                "sense_id": "096a03c2-5ecb-3c85-b616-f0fa87fd7a6b",
                                "text": "... a haggy creature with the chubby son, who stops her gardening and stares every time we leave the house."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
